    "content" : "I made this sheath for my dad&#39;s new &quot;chainsaw&quot;. He just got this handsaw sharpened and wanted something to protect it so he could carry it around. It&#39;s nothing special and was made with scrap wood he had laying around. The saw is bungeed in place and this allows one to carry it with the saw&#39;s handle when it&#39;s sheathed. ",
    "objectType" : "note",
    "originalContent" : "I made this sheath for my dad's new \"chainsaw\". He just got this handsaw sharpened and wanted something to protect it so he could carry it around. It's nothing special and was made with scrap wood he had laying around. The saw is bungeed in place and this allows one to carry it with the saw's handle when it's sheathed. ",
